---
import Icon from "../ui/Icon.astro";
---

<div
  id="parcelDrawer"
  class="absolute top-0 right-0 h-full w-96 max-w-full bg-surface-container-lowest text-on-surface shadow-2xl z-30 transform translate-x-full transition-transform duration-300 flex flex-col border-l border-outline-variant/40"
>
  <div class="p-4 bg-inverse-surface text-surface flex items-center justify-between border-b border-inverse-surface/40">
    <div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
        <span class="font-mono text-base font-bold text-primary-fixed" id="drawerParcelId">MCH-000</span>
        <span id="drawerStatusBadge" class="text-[10px] uppercase font-bold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-primary/20 text-on-primary-container">APROBADA</span>
      </div>
      <p class="text-label-sm font-label-sm text-on-surface/60 mt-0.5" id="drawerMunicipio">Municipio</p>
    </div>
    <button
      type="button"
      id="btnCloseDrawer"
      class="p-1 rounded-lg text-on-surface/60 hover:text-surface hover:bg-inverse-surface/40 transition-colors"
      aria-label="Cerrar panel"
    >
      <Icon name="close" size={20} />
    </button>
  </div>

  <div class="flex-1 overflow-y-auto p-4 space-y-5 text-label-sm font-label-sm">
    <section class="space-y-2">
      <h3 class="text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-on-surface-variant flex items-center gap-1">
        <Icon name="badge" size={14} />
        Ficha del Predio
      </h3>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-2 bg-surface-container-low p-3 rounded-lg border border-outline-variant/40">
        <div>
          <span class="text-on-surface-variant block text-[10px]">Propietario:</span>
          <span class="font-semibold text-on-surface" id="drawerPropietario">-</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <span class="text-on-surface-variant block text-[10px]">Superficie:</span>
          <span class="font-semibold text-on-surface" id="drawerSuperficie">- ha</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <span class="text-on-surface-variant block text-[10px]">Cultivo:</span>
          <span class="font-semibold text-on-surface" id="drawerCultivo">-</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <span class="text-on-surface-variant block text-[10px]">NDVI Promedio:</span>
          <span class="font-semibold text-primary font-mono" id="drawerNdvi">-</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <span class="text-on-surface-variant block text-[10px]">Fecha de Alta:</span>
          <span class="font-semibold text-on-surface" id="drawerFecha">-</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <span class="text-on-surface-variant block text-[10px]">Confianza IA:</span>
          <span class="font-semibold text-on-surface font-mono" id="drawerConfianza">-</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-2">
      <h3 class="text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-on-surface-variant flex items-center gap-1">
        <Icon name="history_toggle_off" size={14} />
        Historial Satelital de Cobertura
      </h3>
      <div id="drawerDeforestationList" class="space-y-2"></div>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-2 rounded-xl bg-inverse-surface p-3 text-surface" id="drawerSatelliteComparison">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2">
        <h3 class="text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-secondary-fixed flex items-center gap-1">
          <Icon name="compare_arrows" size={14} />
          Comparativa Satelital
        </h3>
        <span class="text-[9px] font-mono text-inverse-on-surface/70">Esri Wayback</span>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-2">
        <div class="space-y-1">
          <div id="drawerFromYearLabel" class="text-[10px] font-mono text-inverse-on-surface/70">Año inicial</div>
          <div class="h-24 overflow-hidden rounded-lg border border-surface/10 bg-black">
            <img id="drawerFromYearImage" src="" alt="Imagen satelital del año inicial" class="h-full w-full object-cover" />
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="space-y-1">
          <div id="drawerToYearLabel" class="text-[10px] font-mono text-secondary-fixed">Año final</div>
          <div class="h-24 overflow-hidden rounded-lg border border-secondary-fixed/30 bg-black">
            <img id="drawerToYearImage" src="" alt="Imagen satelital del año final" class="h-full w-full object-cover" />
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p id="drawerComparisonNotice" class="text-[10px] leading-relaxed text-inverse-on-surface/70"></p>
      <button
        id="btnRunGeminiAudit"
        type="button"
        class="w-full rounded-lg bg-primary px-3 py-2 text-[11px] font-bold text-on-primary transition-colors hover:bg-primary-container"
      >
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5"><Icon name="auto_awesome" size={15} /> Auditar ambos años con Gemini</span>
      </button>
      <div id="geminiLoading" class="hidden rounded-lg border border-secondary-fixed/30 bg-surface/10 p-2 text-center text-[10px] text-secondary-fixed">
        Analizando las dos imágenes y los incendios NASA FIRMS...
      </div>
      <div id="geminiAlertBox" class="hidden rounded-lg border border-error/50 bg-error/10 p-2 text-[10px] text-red-200"></div>
      <div id="geminiResultBox" class="hidden space-y-2 rounded-lg border border-secondary-fixed/30 bg-black/20 p-2 text-[10px]">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2 border-b border-surface/10 pb-1">
          <strong id="geminiVerdictTitle">Resultado de auditoría</strong>
          <span id="geminiConfidenceBadge" class="font-mono text-secondary-fixed"></span>
        </div>
        <p id="geminiComparisonSummary" class="leading-relaxed text-inverse-on-surface/80"></p>
        <div id="geminiTimelineList" class="space-y-1 border-l border-secondary-fixed/50 pl-2"></div>
        <p id="geminiExplanation" class="leading-relaxed text-inverse-on-surface/80"></p>
        <p id="geminiConclusionLegal" class="rounded bg-error/10 p-2 leading-relaxed text-red-200"></p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-2">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-outline-variant/40 pb-1">
        <h3 class="text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-on-surface flex items-center gap-1">
          <Icon name="local_fire_department" size={14} class="text-orange-600" />
          Comparativa NASA FIRMS (2012–2026)
        </h3>
        <span id="drawerFireCount" class="text-[9px] font-mono font-bold px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-orange-100 text-orange-800">
          0 eventos
        </span>
      </div>

      <div id="drawerVedaBanner" class="hidden p-2.5 rounded-lg bg-red-50 border border-red-300 text-red-950 space-y-1">
        <div class="font-bold text-xs flex items-center gap-1 text-red-700">
          <Icon name="gavel" size={16} />
          <span>VEDA FORESTAL ACTIVA (ART. 97 LGDFS)</span>
        </div>
        <p id="drawerVedaText" class="text-[11px] leading-tight"></p>
      </div>

      <div id="drawerFireList" class="space-y-1.5"></div>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-2">
      <h3 class="text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-on-surface-variant flex items-center gap-1">
        <Icon name="polyline" size={14} />
        Validación Geométrica (Turf.js)
      </h3>
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between rounded-lg bg-surface-container-low px-2.5 py-2 text-[10px] text-on-surface-variant">
        <span>Comparativa contra el catastro cargado</span>
        <strong id="drawerGeometryScore" class="font-mono text-primary">100/100</strong>
      </div>
      <div id="drawerGeometryIssues" class="space-y-1.5"></div>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-2 pt-2 border-t border-outline-variant/40">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
        <h3 class="text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-on-surface flex items-center gap-1">
          <Icon name="gavel" size={14} class="text-error" />
          Regla Anti-Subdivisión
        </h3>
        <span class="text-[9px] px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-error-container text-error font-semibold">Art. 15días</span>
      </div>
      <p class="text-[11px] text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
        Si un predio registra tala o cambio de uso de suelo, el sistema <strong>impide fraccionarlo</strong> para que partes limpias puedan exportar. Lo que importa es la historia total del terreno.
      </p>

      <button
        id="btnTestSubdivision"
        type="button"
        class="w-full py-2.5 px-3 rounded-lg bg-inverse-surface hover:bg-on-surface text-surface font-medium flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 shadow transition-all"
      >
        <Icon name="call_split" size={16} />
        <span>Simular Intento de Subdivisión</span>
      </button>

      <div id="subdivisionAlertBox" class="hidden p-3 rounded-lg border text-[11px] leading-relaxed transition-all"></div>
    </section>
  </div>
</div>
